# I47 (REVIEW-PHASE1-R20): the agent's build outputs must not ride into the
# verified commit (the commit is pushed to the repo by S6 delivery). The
# runner's commitWorkspace refuses any NEW file over 1 MiB or binary — but
# the SEED repo should carry its own .gitignore so the Go build output (the
# webapi binary, as produced by 'go build' in the module root) is ignored
# at staging time (the runner's guard is the backstop for a .gitignore-less
# workspace). This file is committed into the seeded repo
# (hack/samples-seed.sh seeds from the committed tree), so the webapi Loop's
# workspace has it from the base commit.
/webapi
*.exe
